$ <mcp taskhub> tools/list
- add_task: Add a task with optional due date and tag.
- edit_task: Edit task fields (title, due date, tag) by id.
- init_storage: Initialize tasks.json storage. Returns its path.
- list_tasks: List tasks, optionally filtered by status and tag.
- mark_done: Mark a task as done by id.
- undo_tasks: Undo last N modifications to tasks.json (max 3).
- validate_tasks: Validate tasks.json integrity: schema, dates, duplicate ids.
